  "summary": "基礎指令 軟體包管理器 電腦硬體 應用軟體 基礎指令 # 回「家目錄」 # cd ~ ``` text ### 回「上一層資料夾」 ``` bash cd .. 列出所在資料夾檔案 # ls ``` text ### 列出當前所在目錄 ``` bash pwd 超級權限 # 如果執行出現錯誤，可以試試看指令前加上 sudo，使用最高權限者的身份執行。 sudo [ 你要執行的指令 ] ``` text --- 有些指令須要安裝程式，請善用 apt、brew 等等「app store」也就是「軟體包管理器」來安裝，如果執行底下指令發現找不到指令，請先安裝。 ## 軟體包管理器{#package-manager} ### apt（Linux 系統常用） Linux 內建，每次使用前要養成「更新」習慣。 ``` b…",
  "content": "<table>\n  <thead>\n      <tr>\n          <th><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">基礎指令</a></th>\n          <th><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">軟體包管理器</a></th>\n          <th><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">電腦硬體</a></th>\n          <th><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">應用軟體</a></th>\n      </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>\n  基礎指令\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<h3>\n  回「家目錄」\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<div><pre><code><span><span>cd ~\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span><span>### 回「上一層資料夾」</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>cd ..\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h3>\n  列出所在資料夾檔案\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<div><pre><code><span><span>ls\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span><span>### 列出當前所在目錄</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>pwd\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h3>\n  超級權限\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>如果執行出現錯誤，可以試試看指令前加上 sudo，使用最高權限者的身份執行。</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>sudo <span>[</span>你要執行的指令<span>]</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>---\n</span></span><span><span>有些指令須要安裝程式，請善用 apt、brew 等等「app store」也就是「軟體包管理器」來安裝，如果執行底下指令發現找不到指令，請先安裝。\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>## 軟體包管理器{#package-manager}</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>### apt（Linux 系統常用）</span>\n</span></span><span><span>Linux 內建，每次使用前要養成「更新」習慣。\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>sudo apt update\n</span></span></code></pre></div><p>安裝要的 App</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>sudo apt install <span>[</span>你要的 app<span>]</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>### HomeBrew（macOS 系統常用）</span>\n</span></span><span><span>安裝 HomeBrew\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>依照 <span>[</span>HomeBrew 官方網站<span>](</span>https://brew.sh/zh-tw/<span>)</span>最新提供指令為主\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>/bin/bash -c <span>&quot;</span><span>$(</span>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh<span>)</span><span>&quot;</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></div><p>安裝要的 app</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>brew install <span>[</span>你要的 app<span>]</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>---\n</span></span><span><span><span>## 電腦硬體{#hardware}</span>\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>### 電池健康度查詢</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>upower -i <span>$(</span>upower -e | grep <span>&#x27;battery&#x27;</span><span>)</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h3>\n  smartmontools 聰明系統控制工具\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>安裝 smartmontools 聰明系統控制工具</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>sudo apt install smartmontools\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span><span>#### 電池電量重新整理</span>\n</span></span><span><span>覺得顯示電量與實際電量有落差時使用\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>重新啟動 upower\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>sudo systemctl restart upower\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h4>\n  檢查硬碟健康\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>只顯示健康度是否 pass</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>sudo smartctl -H /dev/nvme0n1\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span>顯示完整報告\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>sudo smartctl -a /dev/nvme0n1\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h3>\n  CPU、RAM 使用率查詢\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<div><pre><code><span><span>htop\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span><span>### 查看所有溫度感應、風扇</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>sensors\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h2>\n  應用軟體\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<h3>\n  下載影片\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>yt-dlp 下載影片：<a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/yt-dlp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">詳細步驟</a></p>\n<p>下載影片</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>yt-dlp <span>&quot;youtube 網址&quot;</span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>text\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>下載聲音（下載原影片的最高音質檔案，並轉換為 mp3 格式）\n</span></span><span><span><span>```</span>bash\n</span></span><span><span>yt-dlp --extract-audio --audio-format mp3 --audio-quality <span>0</span> <span>&quot;youtube 網址&quot;</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></div>",
